Package: kgmselect
Type: Package
Title: Profiled Model Selection for Kronecker Graphical Models
Version: 0.1.4
Authors@R: c(
    person("Kyung Han", "Lee", email = "rudgksdl94@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Min Jin", "Ha", role = "aut"))
Description: Fits sparse Kronecker (tensor-normal) graphical models along a
    regularisation path whose factors are normalised to unit Frobenius norm,
    and selects a candidate on the path by the extended Bayesian information
    criterion evaluated at the normalised fit, by a scale-profiled version of
    it or by a relaxation-profiled version that also adjusts the shrunken
    coefficients along support-preserving directions. Cross-validation, the
    stability approach to regularisation selection and support-constrained
    refitting are included for comparison.
